### READ: all actors
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/actor

### READ: one actor
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/actor/1

### CREATE: add an actor (the server assigns the id)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/actor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sam Wilson",
  "movieName": "Lost City"
}

### UPDATE (PUT): replace name and movieName of actor 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/actor/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe Jr.",
  "movieName": "The Great Adventure 2"
}

### UPDATE (PATCH): change only the movieName of actor 2
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/actor/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieName": "Mystery Island Returns"
}

### DELETE: remove actor 2
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/actor/2

### READ: a missing actor returns 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/actor/99
